"Conan!" you whisper, "the rifle...shoot!"
Trembling with fear Conan points father's double-barrelled rifle at the beast Seconds are crawling slowly, so agonizingly slowly...
Finally, he fires. Hushed jungle is torn by a wild howl. For a second you think that you made it, but the beast seems to be intact. Conan has probably managed to injure it, but the wound is not lethal. Evidently, the beast is furious.
Conan is about to shoot the second barrel, but at this moment the predator is advancing. You hear awful screams of your friends and try to flee, but it's too late. Your adventure ends here. 